### Test artifacts ###
# Go test coverage artifacts at any depth (go test -coverprofile output)
coverage.out
coverage.html

### Security: Secrets & Credentials ###

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
# `task setup` copies each committed .env*.example to its real, ignored name.
!.env*.example

# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
# Published playground PEM, paired with public/fixtures/private-jwk.json.
# Allow this public key for the debugger's playground-only copy tools.
!public/fixtures/public-key.pem

# API keys and tokens
*.secret
*-secret.*
*.credentials
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# Cloud provider configs with secrets
.aws/credentials
.gcloud/
.azure/

